    given-names: "David"
title: "Von Mangoldt Hierarchies: Zero-Residue Polynomials and Explicit Formulas"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2024-01-01
url: "https://github.com/davidengland/von-mangoldt-hierarchies"
repository-code: "https://github.com/davidengland/von-mangoldt-hierarchies"
keywords:
  - "analytic number theory"
  - "L-functions"
  - "explicit formulas"
  - "zero-residue polynomials"
  - "von Mangoldt function"
  - "Riemann zeta function"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  A framework for analyzing zeros of L-functions through 
  zero-residue polynomials P_k(ρ, λ). Includes explicit 
  formulas for higher von Mangoldt functions, pairing 
  identities for oscillatory sums, and computational tools.
